Vendored design-system CSS (legal-hardening commit 11, spec §8.2).

The site must build hermetically: site/package.json no longer depends on the
local `file:../../veto-design-system/...` packages (@veto/tokens, @veto/web),
which are UNLICENSED and exist only on the author's machine. Instead, their
built CSS is copied here and imported by relative path from site/src/main.tsx.

Files:
- tokens.css  — from ../../veto-design-system/packages/tokens/dist/tokens.css
                (@veto/tokens v0.1.0; generated from src/tokens.json)
- veto-web.css — from ../../veto-design-system/packages/web/dist/veto-web.css
                (@veto/web v0.1.0)

Re-copy procedure: rebuild the upstream package, then copy its dist CSS over
the file here, keeping the 7-line "VENDORED" header at the top (source path
and version). The header records which package version each file came from.

Do NOT publish these packages to fix the build — publishing is blocked until
the design-system repo has a chosen license (a human decision, spec §12).
